{"id":"n83726-1-7","stage":1,"title":"학생증 · 学生证","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83726-1-7-1","ko":"저 이 학교 학생인데 도서관 안으로 들어갈 수 없나요?","zh":"我是这所学校的学生，不能进图书馆吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학교","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학생인데","meaning":"学生","explanation":"학생：学生；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"학생","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31670","senseId":"1","lemma":"학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도서관","meaning":"图书馆","explanation":"도서관：图书馆","readings":[{"term":"도서관","audio":"/audio/9ee22c8536d3503a4b1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40295","senseId":"1","lemma":"도서관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안으로","meaning":"里，里面","explanation":"안：里，里面；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74890","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어갈","meaning":"进，进去","explanation":"들어가다：进，进去；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없나요?","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"f24650b42089c29f","term":"학생","zh":"学生","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3","entryId":"31670","definition":"在学校学习的人。","pronunciation":["학쌩"]},{"id":"9ee22c8536d3503a","term":"도서관","zh":"图书馆","audio":"/audio/9ee22c8536d3503a4b1c.mp3","entryId":"40295","definition":"收藏大量书籍和资料等，以供人们借阅或学习而建造的设施。","pronunciation":["도서관"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"里，里面","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"74890","definition":"从某物体或空间的周围向着中间的方向；或指那样的部分。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","term":"들어가다","zh":"进，进去","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3","entryId":"67877","definition":"由外往里去。","pronunciation":["드러가다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/568dcdaaa1e49eeeabdf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83726-1-7-2","ko":"학생증을 보여 주셔야 합니다.","z